5. Difference between String, StringBuilder, and StringBuffer. When to use which?

String → Immutable, safe, slow.
StringBuffer → Mutable, thread-safe(because its synchronized allow operations one after another),
 moderate speed.
StringBuilder → Mutable, not thread-safe(not synchronized multiple string access same resource results in corrupted date)
,fastest.

